owdown cheaply or induce a bluff from missed draws.\n\nReason: I have a medium strength hand (Two pair with a good kicker). The board texture with the paired 5 and the presence of a Jack means there are realistic hands in the opponent's range that beat me. Betting unlikely extracts value from worse hands, whereas checking keeps the pot small and allows me to win at showdown against bluffs or weaker pairs without risking more chips.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
